# Project Rules

- Always read `TASKS.md`, `COMMAND.md`, and `AGENTS.md` before starting work.
- Cursor only edits `apps/console/**` and `packages/ui/**`.
- Use the existing design tokens and shared UI components first.
- Keep UI work responsive, with loading, empty, error, and success states.
- Do not change database schema, backend APIs, Docker, or auth logic.
- Prefer small, task-scoped branches named `feature/<TaskID>-<short-name>`.
- After each task, list changed files and run lint plus typecheck.
- Update `TASKS.md` when the task is done or blocked.
